  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Shader keywords build up over time. When coming across just a few users or worlds that hog your keywords, you are already running into Unity's limit and you have to restart the game for things to work correctly.\n\nCould the list of keywords perhaps be cleared when switching to a new instance? That would make shaders break far less often and make restarts less common.",
